      "summary": "Performed CanUD TWAS with adult and fetal cortex expression models and European 1000 Genomes reference LD. A weighted gene burden test combined SNP-trait associations with expression weights. Reference model filters included nominal cis-heritability P<0.01 and five-fold prediction R2>0.01 at nominal P<0.01; transcriptome-wide significance was P<2.5e-6.",
      "scope": "Reference training filters and association thresholds are paper settings; exact FUSION edition, executable environment and complete caller options are unreported. Current synthetic qualification is not the CanUD study or a reconstruction of its cortex models.",
