      "summary": "Performed hypothyroidism TWAS with six GTEx v8 tissues (hypothalamus, pituitary, thyroid, spleen, whole blood and pancreas), followed by internal COLOC. The paper considered gene associations at P<2.97e-6 and reported shared-causal evidence at PP4>0.75 for genes within sentinel-variant windows.",
