      "summary": "Performed univariate FUSION TWAS with reported defaults and 45 European GTEx v8 tissue weights before Genomic SEM T-SEM. FUSION colocalization with the same weights was integrated with T-SEM; PP4>0.80 identified colocalized genes. The reported Genomic SEM0.0.5 and ACAT0.91 versions belong to separate packages.",
      "scope": "Genomic SEM and ACAT versions are not FUSION versions. Current availability covers FUSION training/association/colocalization and postprocessing; it does not reproduce the external Genomic SEM T-SEM model or infer unstated historical FUSION options.",
