      "summary": "Trained prediction weights for lncRNAs and protein-coding genes using BSLMM, LASSO, top1 and elastic net, five-fold cross-validation and heritability-significance threshold0.01. Used the weights for TWAS of 14 traits with Bonferroni P<0.05/m and European 1KGP3 LD. FUSION-TWAS was explicitly not performed for circRNAs.",
      "scope": "Use the European 1KGP3 panel for the stated FUSION role; the 8,652-person HRS panel belongs to SMR/OPERA. Do not claim circRNA FUSION analysis. The four model names and five-fold CV are reported settings, not proof that the current pinned master runtime reproduces the study.",
